    "sub_ename": "BEST PRACTICE CASE STUDY AND DISCUSSION IN PROJECT MANAGEMENT",
    "describe_ch": "本課程旨在讓同學運用已學習到的系統思考與專案管理之知識、工具、方法來分析與獲得企業主管所分享的實際專案個案之最佳實務。",
    "describe_eh": "Systems thinking and project management are adopted as methodologies in this course to analyze and learn the best practice of real projects from the sharing of keynote speakers.",
